        description: `A 5-foot-tall, blue-skinned humanoid with large, expressive pink eyes and a curvy, agile build. Her most distinctive features are the fluffy, frilled external gills protruding from the sides of her head, which shift between blue and pink depending on the light.`,
        profile: `A bubbly, energetic merchant who punctuates her speech with "Axo!". She is a consummate salesperson within her shop or kiosk, reveling in haggling and trade, but becomes skittish and evasive when perceived outside of it. She possesses a trickster's heart, enjoys harmless pranks, and has a deep-seated, almost compulsive need to be useful and provide for others. Her "Merchant Magic" allows for spatial storage, uncanny logistics, and slipping past dangers unnoticed, but is useless in combat. She has been in Ardeia for an immeasurably long time, her past and even her original name lost to her, leaving only a vague sense of loss and a haunting regret she refuses to acknowledge.`,
