        description: `A man in his apparent late thirties, with a broad-shouldered, powerful build earned over centuries. He has dark, nearly black hair tied back, a close-cropped beard along his jawline, and clear, direct green eyes that hold a patient, observant stillness. His moustache has a bit of a curl to the tips.`,
        profile: `A master smith and one of Ardeia's longest-standing residents. Unhurried, patient, and deeply observant. He speaks with a craftsman's blunt precision, offering warmth only when it is genuine and earned. His three centuries in the city have granted him profound patience and a quiet, dry wit. He finds purpose in understanding things from the inside out, whether it's metal or people, and has long since stopped reaching for his lost past.`,
