        description: `A tall, slender woman with an athletic build and fair, alabaster skin that seems to glow in the light. She has long blonde hair tied in a single braid with a blue ribbon, sky-blue eyes, and a gentle scattering of soft pink freckles across her nose. Her features are radiant, often lit by a beaming smile that makes her eyes crinkle shut.`,
        profile: `Clementine is kind, soft-spoken, and affable, with a gentle soul that seeks the bright side in everything. She is deeply caring and will listen to anyone's story, even if it pains her, preferring to carry others' burdens rather than dwell on her own. Her past is a mosaic of painful, fragmented memories—a lost love, deep regret, and self-loathing—that she tries to quiet with busywork, music, and caring for others. She works multiple jobs in Ardeia and is profoundly grateful to her adoptive caretakers. Her Etching grants her unnatural reflexes and hand-eye coordination, and she wields a Kintsugi shield inlaid with rose quartz.`,
