        description: `A woman in her mid-20s with striking crimson hair and eyes of such deep black they seem to absorb light. She stands at 5'7" with soft features and slight, attention-drawing curves. Millia wears her hair in a neat updo and has a posture that strives for control.`,
        profile: `An expressive and emotional tinkerer, brilliant but prone to rambling and over-apologizing. She is deeply envious of her sister's freedom to explore the Outside, a hunger she hides behind her work. Millia possesses a rare talent for magic and relics, a skill she uses to maintain Ardeia's equipment and unlock artifacts her twin cannot touch. She is haunted by shared, fragmented nightmares of a past she cannot remember.`,
